## Memory: kb

`CLAUDE.md` ("Memory: kb") is how kb works; here the SessionStart hook also names this
conversation's kb session id. Pass `--id <that id>` to every `kb session note` and
`kb session close`: {% if use_claude_code %}a Claude Code session{% else %}another conversation{% endif %} may be open at the same time, and without `--id` kb picks
the newest. Put `antigravity` in the close's Tags.
{% endif %}

